1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,320
You see that bird?

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,520
This lake turned it

3
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:04,160
to STONE.

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,092
Not stone,

5
00:00:05,092 --> 00:00:06,240
actually...

6
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,467
it's a MUMMY.

7
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,820
This water's like hot

8
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,947
washing soda.

9
00:00:09,947 --> 00:00:11,500
It BURNS.

10
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:12,572
Whatever falls in

11
00:00:12,572 --> 00:00:13,730
gets dried out...

12
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,333
and crusted over.

13
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:16,570
Egyptians made mummies

14
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:18,233
with the same salt.

15
00:00:18,277 --> 00:00:19,798
And flamingos?

16
00:00:19,798 --> 00:00:21,433
They LOVE it.

17
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:22,342
Most of the world's

18
00:00:22,342 --> 00:00:23,650
lesser flamingos

19
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,933
hatch right here...

20
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:25,978
because nothing dares

21
00:00:25,978 --> 00:00:27,700
wade in after them.

22
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:28,644
So if a flamingo

23
00:00:28,644 --> 00:00:29,540
says the water's

24
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,630
lovely...

25
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:31,616
don't.

